c['gaps'][0]='Canada: every CMO paper1969–2026 has been reviewed. Four individual questions remain held:1969Q1 (undefined denominator),1974Q7 (timetable assumptions),1990Q5 (unproved recurrence run-length law),2001Q5 (undefined ratio). All other CMO questions have individual numeric assessments. All CJMO2020–2026 fully screened. Official worked solutions are linked only from1994; earlier included questions have original independently checked proofs.'
